th=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">独立窗口推断</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">90窗同一评价分母</text></g>\n </svg></div><figcaption>详细原理、数据图表与计算见下方各步骤。<span data-flow-instruction></span></figcaption></figure><div class=\"xl-step-nav\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"方法步骤\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"xl-method-0\" data-xl-step=\"0\">01 计算振动特征</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"xl-method-1\" data-xl-step=\"1\">02 拟合二分类器</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"xl-method-2\" data-xl-step=\"2\">03 查看频谱并评价</button></div><article class=\"xl-method-step\" id=\"xl-method-0\" data-xl-panel=\"0\"><div class=\"xl-step-heading\"><span class=\"xl-kicker\">01 / 3</span><h3>计算振动特征</h3></div><div class=\"xl-action-copy\"><b>输入与动作</b><p>独立设备片段计算RMS、频带比和峰值因子。</p></div><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><caption>分别比较时域幅度与频带成分（手算教学例）</caption><thead><tr><th>分量</th><th>频率 / Hz</th><th>幅值 / g</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>正常旋转载荷</td><td>5</td><td>1.1</td></tr><tr><td>教学退化成分</td><td>25</td><td>0.98</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"xl-products\"><div><b>得到什么</b><p>160个带标签训练窗</p></div><div><b>理解这一步</b><p>采样率、窗口长度和频率刻度一起记录。</p></div></div></article><article class=\"xl-method-step\" id=\"xl-method-1\" data-xl-panel=\"1\"><div class=\"xl-step-heading\"><span class=\"xl-kicker\">02 / 3</span><h3>拟合二分类器</h3></div><div class=\"xl-action-copy\"><b>输入与动作</b><p>在训练窗上拟合带正则逻辑回归。</p></div><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><caption>组合特征再学习权重（手算教学例）</caption><thead><tr><th>特征</th><th>计算</th><th>含义</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>RMS</td><td>√mean(a²)</td><td>总体幅度/g</td></tr><tr><td>频带比</td><td>P25/(P5+0.02)</td><td>对负荷幅度作相对参照</td></tr><tr><td>峰值因子</td><td>max|a|/RMS</td><td>波形尖锐程度</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"xl-products\"><div><b>得到什么</b><p>冻结特征系数</p></div><div><b>理解这一步</b><p>分数用于比较当前窗口与训练状态的相似程度。</p></div></div></article><article class=\"xl-method-step\" id=\"xl-method-2\" data-xl-panel=\"2\"><div class=\"xl-step-heading\"><span class=\"xl-kicker\">03 / 3</span><h3>查看频谱并评价</h3></div><div class=\"xl-action-copy\"><b>输入与动作</b><p>对90个独立测试窗推断，切换窗口定位频带。</p></div><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><caption>误报和漏报应分别定位（手算教学例）</caption><thead><tr><th>评价对象</th><th>真实正常</th><th>真实退化</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>测试窗数</td><td>50</td><td>40</td></tr><tr><td>误判类型</td><td>告警=误报</td><td>未告警=漏报</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"xl-products\"><div><b>得到什么</b><p>F1、漏报与误报</p></div><div><b>理解这一步</b><p>类别标签在预测完成后用于计算留出成绩。</p></div></div></article><div class=\"xl-next\"><button type=\"button\" data-xl-tab=\"lab\">用当前数据检验这条流程 →</button></div></div>"
