      "lessonHTML": "<div class=\"xl-method\"><div class=\"xl-opening\"><span class=\"xl-kicker\">沿着资料走一遍</span><h2>高负荷也会产生大振动，怎样避免把负荷变化全部当成退化？</h2><p>图中的分支对应方法和基线；下面每一步都说明输入、动作与产物，进入演示后可改变条件查看实际数值。</p></div><figure class=\"case-flow-overview case-flow-compact study-workflow-overview\" data-flow-scene=\"d4\" style=\"margin:18px 0 24px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fafbf9;border:1px solid #e0e6e0;border-radius:8px;min-width:0;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><style>.case-flow-compact h3{font-size:19px!important;line-height:1.6!important;color:#355a50;margin:0 0 5px!important}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-scroll{overflow-x:auto;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;overscroll-behavior-x:contain}.case-flow-compact svg{display:block;width:100%;min-width:940px;height:auto;font-family:system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-title{font-size:19px;font-weight:600;fill:#355a50}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-detail{font-size:14px;fill:#6b8078}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-edge{font-size:13px;fill:#70877d;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#fafbf9;stroke-width:4px}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node rect,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node polygon{stroke:#b7c8bc;stroke-width:1}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node[role=button]{cursor:pointer;outline:none}.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node[aria-current=true] rect,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node[aria-current=true] polygon,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node:focus rect,.case-flow-compact .case-flow-node:focus polygon{stroke:#347a65;stroke-width:2}.case-flow-compact svg text{pointer-events:none}.case-flow-compact figcaption{font-size:14px!important;line-height:1.7!important;color:#75877b;margin:4px 0 0!important}</style><h3>本例方法概览</h3><div class=\"case-flow-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"流程概览，可横向滚动\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1100 250\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"钻具状态识别：振动变大还是频带变了\"><defs><marker id=\"cf-d4\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"